Hi Dana,

Your November module, "Spotting credential phishing", is now available. It takes about eight minutes.

A taste of what you will learn to spot. This is an EXAMPLE of a phishing email, not a real request:

    "URGENT: your mailbox password expires today. Confirm your password within 4 hours at http://login-example.account-verify.test/keep or your account will be suspended."

Notice the pressure, the deadline and the look-alike address.

Start the module from your learning dashboard: https://learn.brightline-awareness.example/modules/nov

Thanks for helping keep Example Corp safe,
